      "lines": [
        "球门46球.今年“礼炮”队射入对方球门39球，对方射",
        "入“礼炮”队球门24球.分别求出：1)去年，2)今年，“礼",
        "炮”队射中的球数和丢的球数的差."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "393",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "求差并且验算：",
        "1) $2-22$；　　2) $-5-4$；　　3) $-3-(-1)$；",
        "4) $-1-(-3)$；5) $7-(-2)$；6) $-4-(-6)$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "394",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "作减法：",
        "1) $10-(-3)$；　　2) $12-(-14)$；",
        "3) $-21-(-19)$；4) $9-(-9)$；",
        "5) $-1.4-1.4$；　　6) $-5.6-(-3.1)$；",
        "7) $2.5-8.5$；　　8) $0-(-40.6)$；",
        "9) $0-64.8$；　　10) $-7.62-(-7.62)$；",
        "11) $-0.21-0$；　　12) $8.7-4.3$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "395",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "解方程并且检验：",
        "1) $-2+x=4.3$；　　2) $8.1+y=-6$；",
        "3) $5-x=1.7$；　　4) $x+3=-1.6$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "396",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "把以下的差化成和的形式：",
        "1) $-28-(-32)$；2) $-46-30$；3) $50-(-24)$；",
        "4) $x-80$；　　5) $-30-p$；6) $6-(-a)$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "397",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "说出下列和中的每个加数：",
        "1) $-8+x$；　　2) $x-6$；　　3) $-m-25$；",
        "4) $10-a+m$；5) $-a+9-m$；6) $-a-b-c$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "398",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "求下列各式的值：",
        "1) $-18-28$；2) $12-30$；　　3) $-46+7$；",
        "4) $54-51$；5) $62-28-40$；6) $-50+37+30$；"
      ]
    },
